/2639?rev=7\">r7</a></td><td><details><summary>Refactored state and node management methods</summary>Added comprehensive documentation, removed deprecated database transaction methods, and enhanced node and state management functions with more explicit error handling and comments</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2639?rev=6\">r6</a></td><td><details><summary>Refactored pre-auth key registration logic</summary>Restructured pre-authentication key handling in authentication flow, improved error handling, and moved validation logic to PreAuthKey type</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2639?rev=5\">r5</a></td><td><details><summary>Policy change notifications added to methods</summary>Updated multiple methods to track and notify about policy changes when modifying node state, adding explicit policy change tracking and notification mechanisms</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2639?rev=4\">r4</a></td><td><details><summary>Added policy change tracking in state</summary>Modified state methods to return policy change status and added helper methods to update policy manager for users and nodes</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2639?rev=3\">r3</a></td><td><details><summary>Uncommented and improved ephemeral node deletion</summary>Implemented ephemeral garbage collector with improved error handling and node retrieval before deletion</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2639?rev=2\">r2</a></td><td><details><summary>Refactored state management methods</summary>Comprehensive refactoring of state management methods with improved method signatures, error handling, and consistency across user, node, and policy operations</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2639?rev=1\">r1</a></td><td><details><summary>Introduced new state management architecture</summary>Refactored Headscale core architecture by introducing a new centralized state management system with a unified <code>state.State</code> struct that consolidates database, policy, routing, and registration cache interactions.</details></td></tr></table><hr/>☑️ AI review skipped for <a href=\"https://review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2639?rev=9\">r9</a><details><summary>Help</summary>\nReact with emojis to give feedback on AI-generated reviews:\n<ul>\n<li>👍 means the feedback was helpful and actionable</li>\n<li>👎 means the feedback was incorrect or unhelpful</li>\n</ul>\n💬 Replying to feedback with a comment helps us improve the system. Your input also contributes to shaping future interactions with the AI reviewer.\n<br/><br/>\nWe'd love to hear from you—reach out anytime at <a href=\"mailto:team@review.ai\">team@review.ai</a>.\n</details>","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/2927692230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events