"gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"auto_squash_enabled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-06-23T21:19:20Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":18286076241,"node_id":"AMDE_lADOEFLz8865O208zwAAAARB72FR","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/18286076241","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"auto_merge_disabled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-06-24T05:32:22Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"750f90b81a503095237912af28f83f6b1cdee965","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDc1MGY5MGI4MWE1MDMwOTUyMzc5MTJhZjI4ZjgzZjZiMWNkZWU5NjU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/750f90b81a503095237912af28f83f6b1cdee965","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/750f90b81a503095237912af28f83f6b1cdee965","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-05-27T14:27:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-06-24T05:33:36Z"},"tree":{"sha":"864d1edfb05ffd9bd0f72e0ce4ac8870838259ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/864d1edfb05ffd9bd0f72e0ce4ac8870838259ac"},"message":"state: introduce state\n\nthis commit moves all of the read and write logic, and all different parts\nof headscale that manages some sort of persistent and in memory state into\na separate package.\n\nThe goal of this is to clearly define the boundry between parts of the app\nwhich accesses and modifies data, and where it happens. Previously, different\nstate (routes, policy, db and so on) was used directly, and sometime passed to\nfunctions as pointers.\n\nNow all access has to go through state. In the initial implementation,\nmost of the same functions exists and have just been moved. In the future\ncentralising this will allow us to optimise bottle necks with the database\n(in memory state) and make the different parts talking to eachother do so\nin the same way across headscale components.\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>","parents":[{"sha":"afc11e1f0c1cbdc06716f221380710d92ce75a94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/afc11e1f0c1cbdc06716f221380710d92ce75a94","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/afc11e1f0c1cbdc06716f221380710d92ce75a94"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQE8Ovc4LMmfFHaAjnhg4sr4uQG1/WUhNKVc88qVALZKejOZAxv/FwLswe+4gtYldxG\nP6EqlifISlChTjAccOAAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 864d1edfb05ffd9bd0f72e0ce4ac8870838259ac\nparent afc11e1f0c1cbdc06716f221380710d92ce75a94\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1748356036 +0200\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1750743216 +0200\n\nstate: introduce state\n\nthis commit moves all of the read and write logic, and all different parts\nof headscale that manages some sort of persistent and in memory state into\na separate package.\n\nThe goal of this is to clearly define the boundry between parts of the app\nwhich accesses and modifies data, and where it happens. Previously, different\nstate (routes, policy, db and so on) was used directly, and sometime passed to\nfunctions as pointers.\n\nNow all access has to go through state. In the initial implementation,\nmost of the same functions exists and have just been moved. In the future\ncentralising this will allow us to optimise bottle necks with the database\n(in memory state) and make the different parts talking to eachother do so\nin the same way across headscale components.\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>\n","verified_at":"2025-06-24T05:40:41Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":18286195343,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz8865O208zwAAAARB8TKP","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/18286195343","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","f